{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one","id":1113048,"title":"[Recruitment] New Mage: The Awakening (2e) Player Seeks Game, or to Start One","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-07T19:11:26-07:00","id":1113048,"title":"[Recruitment] New Mage: The Awakening (2e) Player Seeks Game, or to Start One","content":"Hello Everyone! Welcome, Welcome, Welcome.<br /> If you are reading this You are probably interested in either Storytelling or playing in a game of Mage: The Awakening 2nd Edition. I would love to have you join me in my exploration of this game line. I have never run, or played in a game of it and would love to try it out. But I can't do that by myself. Tabletop RPG's are not like that.<br /> <br /> So what do we need to put together a game?<br /> ST: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\">rwknoll</a> </b><br /> <br /> Player1: HaplessWithDice<br /> Player2: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\">rwknoll</a> </b>(Probably)<br /> Player3: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\">Hardwire99</a></b><br /> ----------Optional--------------------<br /> Player 4: (Open)<br /> Player 5: (Open)<br /> <br /> Wow that's a lot of openings! You may notice that players 4 and 5 are optional. Why is that? Well simply put...because 3 feels like the minimum and more than 5 may start to create problems and over crowding. You may also have guessed it but as of the time I am writing this the position for ST is wide open. Yes, we have a game that needs a ST. I haven't run mage before so I don't feel comfortable as the ST. I don't want to half ass the Morality system if I tried to run it on my own that seems some what important to the game.<br /> <br /> Does this mean I don't have Ideas? NO I do, but I don't know mage well enough to run it so...come join in me and let's play mage. Please post your interest and maybe an idea or two of the kind of characters you want to run (maybe a paragraph or two nothing too much). We can fill out those details later.<br /> <br /> -----------------------------For those who want to ST-----------------------------------<br /> So I hate to put too much demand on you but here is what I need from you.<ul><li>A willingness to deal with 1 or more new player in a Play by Post setting.<ul><li>You don't need to spoon feed me answers when I have a question but politely pointing out a page number or section header or general location in the book to find an answer goes a long way.</li> </ul></li> <li>A sense of hope, and optimistic view of your players.</li> <li>The ability to craft a story that has elements of the mystery and the macabre .</li> </ul>I look forward to hearing from you and the players soon future ST.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":600,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","user":"HaplessWithDice","date":". 07-13-2017, 04:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T20:06:00-07:00","id":1113068,"title":"","content":"Here is an example showing the character I would like to play.<br /> <br /> Jason Tayler Shadowname: Charron<br /> Jason was an ordinary young man you spent his time studying without a real aim. He could not figure out what he wanted to do with his life and where he wanted to end up. Without guidance he ended up living his life without a true aim or direction. He searched for something, anything that would give him a path to walk that would be his. He never found it and walked though life going through the motions. His faith provided one pinning point in his life, the other was the need for education These two under pinnings though provide only a scant framework for the young man. He could not determine anything else. He felt like the best two years of his life were in his past, written and done, when he was a missionary for his church out on the Navajo reservation and surrounding cities in New Mexico.<br /> <br /> It was the death of his sister that stirred something in him, that caused him to remember the oddest things, about life, and death. He flung himself into learning about death, about customs and cultures surrounding it, and how to help people morn. He finally found his direction. His study, his life, became death, endings, separation, and helping people not see death as the end but the beginning of something new. That is how he became a Moros mage, by delving deeper and deeper into death, separation, and ends.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T20:51:50-07:00","id":1113082,"title":"","content":"Dunno if you'd be interested, but I am planning on STing a Mage game hosted with Skype &amp; Roll20. Well, more accurately, I'm planning an entire group that will host several Mage games using a common narrative base.<br /> <br /> \u200bIt'll be called Project Hogwarts. The World of Darkness has been revealed to the general public, everyone now knows (or more accurately accepts) that vampires, werewolves, ghosts, and other creatures of the night exist. Shortly afterwards, Awakenings started flooding in. Mages are popping up left, right, and center, and there isn't even a little hint of them slowing down. To control the ensuing chaos, the Pentacle Orders founded a program that gave these new mages training in magic. While the official title of this program is Magical Acquisition Training (or MAT for short), it was nicknamed Project Hogwarts and the name stuck (so much that there are several people who believe the official title is in fact Project Hogwarts).<br /> <br /> \u200bPlayers take the role of one of these newly Awakened.<br /> <br /> \u200bThat's the overall premise, anyways. Keep in mind, that this group is still in development, and it might take awhile yet before it's ready.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T21:05:24-07:00","id":1113090,"title":"","content":"So I've been approached by several players here (including the OP) asking me to consider making room in my game for them, but that game has really stayed active with nearly the entire original cast, so I don't expect it to change soon. <br /> <br /> Instead, I love the idea of getting into another game. I would very much love to play rather than ST. However, I would be willing to consider running a second game if we can't find a ST. If I do run it, I might be a little selfish and ask to run an NPC in the cabal who would basically be my own ST-run player character.<br /> <br /> I would most likely want to play a Thyrsus, probably Mystagogue, no idea on Legacy. I have a few different character concepts I would be interested in. One is an ex-criminal who wants to make something more of his life now that he is Awakened. But I like the idea of a US Army veteran who served in Iraq and has a moderate physical issue (like a bad knee or amputee with prosthetic) from his service and a pet dog he's really fond of. I like the idea of using his dog almost as like a pseudo-familiar.<br /> <br /> Paging <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5241\" data-vbnamecard=\"5241\">Flinty</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a>, who both asked me about a potential game and might still be interested.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T21:16:16-07:00","id":1113093,"title":"","content":"Also paging <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13431_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13431\" data-vbnamecard=\"13431\">Gentle_Rain</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2611-guiskj\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2611_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2611\" data-vbnamecard=\"2611\">guiskj</a>, who might be interested based on posts I've seen on the forums. Not sure if they prefer Vampire games though?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T22:02:51-07:00","id":1113108,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8136_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8136\" data-vbnamecard=\"8136\">rwknoll</a> I'm the one asking you to ST for me. IF you wanted to have a DM PC I wouldn't complain just because it helps me get a game. Getting a game to begin with, especially from a successful online ST is a big thing.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2992_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2992\" data-vbnamecard=\"2992\">crapcarp</a> I don't know if I will have the time for a game played in real time. That is why I am looking for play by post. But I will keep that in mind. There are some, complicated issues that the supernatural world does bring up that if it is common, or partly common knowledge creates interesting legal issues. For example: Uncle Lu was murdered and the cops have no leads are they able to pay a Moros mage to raise Lu's corpse and simply ask it for help in finding it's killer? Does Hank the vampire still have rights as a citizen now that he's a blood sucker? John the Werewolf, is it a hate crime to kill him with silver, when the only thing wrong he's done is intentionally over charge old man Wilkins for when he acted like a racist prick blaming black gays for all the worlds problems, while drinking in John's bar? There are a lot of moral and ethical questions that come up with this, and seeing how you answer them might be amusing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T02:16:58-07:00","id":1113155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HaplessWithDice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1113108#post1113108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2992_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2992\" data-vbnamecard=\"2992\">crapcarp</a> I don't know if I will have the time for a game played in real time. That is why I am looking for play by post. But I will keep that in mind.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bOh, it's by no means an obligation. I kinda figured that a live game would be hard if you were looking for a PBP game. Just throwing it out there as an option.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HaplessWithDice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1113108#post1113108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are some, complicated issues that the supernatural world does bring up that if it is common, or partly common knowledge creates interesting legal issues. For example: Uncle Lu was murdered and the cops have no leads are they able to pay a Moros mage to raise Lu's corpse and simply ask it for help in finding it's killer? Does Hank the vampire still have rights as a citizen now that he's a blood sucker? John the Werewolf, is it a hate crime to kill him with silver, when the only thing wrong he's done is intentionally over charge old man Wilkins for when he acted like a racist prick blaming black gays for all the worlds problems, while drinking in John's bar? There are a lot of moral and ethical questions that come up with this, and seeing how you answer them might be amusing.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bOh, that's some of the first things I thought about when coming up with the concept. Here's the gist of it: While there are several groups out there that are panicking and acting out of fear, most of the general public isn't because they've realized that the supernaturals have been around them the whole time in their societies. Ergo, it can be easily discerned that they have societies of their own that keep them under control. So mortal governments worked with supernatural representatives in creating a treaty that essentially gives supernatural protections under the law, so long as they obey it. Should they break any laws of the mortal society they live in, they are to be punished as dictated by their fellow supernaturals.<br /> <br /> The supernaturals dealing with such criminals have been placed under the obligation to ensure they are punished in a substantial way, as the local mortal society can make a case for invoking the self-defense clause in the treaty. This clause allows a mortal society to make a case that they need to defend themselves against the supernaturals, with an international court. Should the court agree to allow the society to invoke the clause, then the society is allowed to use anything at it's disposal to eliminate the supernaturals under self-defense. Basically, the supernaturals have to play nice, or the mortals get to kill them. Naturally, the clause has been nicknamed the &quot;Stampede Clause&quot;.<br /> <br /> \u200bWhile the treaty is certainly functional, it's nothing more than a patchwork job made in a rush to establish some semblance of order as quickly as possible. As a result, it's riddled with legal loopholes that any savvy politician can exploit the hell out of. As for your specific questions:<br /> <br /> \u200b<i>&quot;Uncle Lu was murdered and the cops have no leads are they able to pay a Moros mage to raise Lu's corpse and simply ask it for help in finding it's killer?</i>\u200b<i>&quot;</i><br /> <br /> \u200bHere's the thing: there's a difference between doing something unlawful and doing something illegal. An unlawful act is one that is strictly against the law, whereas an illegal act is one that legal authorities will prosecute. Resurrecting Uncle Lu could be considered unlawful due to desecrating the dead, but not illegal because the police are causing minimal harm (if any) and are only doing so for the purposes of investigating a case.<br /> <br /> \u200bAnd now I'm getting an image of Phoenix Wright cross examining a zombie.<br /> <br /> \u200b<i>&quot;Does Hank the vampire still have rights as a citizen now that he's a blood sucker?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> \u200bHe does, but as a vampire citizen. If he was a mortal at the time the treaty was made and then Embraced at some later point, his status as a citizen would change and therefore, some of his rights change. This includes things like healthcare only giving him blood, and his property is subject to a 99-year lease (considering his indefinite lifespan), he can only feed off the blood of someone who does and can legally give consent, etc..<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;John the Werewolf, is it a hate crime to kill him with silver, when the only thing wrong he's done is intentionally over charge old man Wilkins for when he acted like a racist prick blaming black gays for all the worlds problems, while drinking in John's bar?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> \u200bDepends on what the mortal society deems is a hate crime. If a hate crime must involve a protected class as a victim, then it wouldn't be considered a hate crime, as supernaturals wouldn't be considered as protected classes. However, if a hate crime is determined by the perpetrator committing the crime specifically out of hate for the victim, then it would. Overcharging old man Wilkins by raising the advertised price isn't a crime (though it is a crime if John didn't give out adequate change for Wilkin's payment).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T06:19:40-07:00","id":1113211,"title":"","content":"Hello all, I was looking at starting a game but it is still several months away (Looking at October to the first of the year). I would like it to be play by post with a possible session or two held in real time if we want to move the story along faster. It would be played on Myth-Weavers for the play by post and Discord/Roll20 for any Live sessions. Roll20 is unlikely unless I can find someone to help me set it up in that format. I will be looking for 5 Characters (All Master, one from each Path) that will be trying to stop a Prophecy that will bring an end to all magic. Yes playing Masters is Challenging and opens the doors for alot of weird stuff.<br /> <br /> I am looking to play in a game, or two, and willing to make this deal. Games that I can play in the ST of that game will have a guaranteed seat in the game that I run. There are several Character concepts that I would like to play. I would like to play in something a little higher than starting level but I can play in a starting level game.<br /> <br /> Any takers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T06:54:33-07:00","id":1113227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1113211#post1113211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello all, I was looking at starting a game but it is still several months away (Looking at October to the first of the year). I would like it to be play by post with a possible session or two held in real time if we want to move the story along faster. It would be played on Myth-Weavers for the play by post and Discord/Roll20 for any Live sessions. Roll20 is unlikely unless I can find someone to help me set it up in that format.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds like you put a lot of planning and effort into it, it is likely to be a lot of fun.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1113211#post1113211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will be looking for 5 Characters (All Master, one from each Path) that will be trying to stop a Prophecy that will bring an end to all magic. Yes playing Masters is Challenging and opens the doors for alot of weird stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a bit higher level than I think I could do, though this might teach me enough about being a mage that I could try it, don't know.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1113211#post1113211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am looking to play in a game, or two, and willing to make this deal. Games that I can play in the ST of that game will have a guaranteed seat in the game that I run. There are several Character concepts that I would like to play. I would like to play in something a little higher than starting level but I can play in a starting level game.<br /> <br /> Any takers?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes I would love to have you on board and added your name in the player 3 spot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T07:03:13-07:00","id":1113230,"title":"","content":"The Prophecy that you are trying to prevent is as Follows:<br /> <br /> The Five will become One<br /> A Soul shattered<br /> A Truth Revealed<br /> Time Yields<br /> The Spilling of Blood.<br /> <br /> I am not finished with it by a long shot and at the moment I have a 51 page document outlining the Chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T07:22:29-07:00","id":1113237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1113230#post1113230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Prophecy that you are trying to prevent is as Follows:<br /> <br /> The Five will become One<br /> A Soul shattered<br /> A Truth Revealed<br /> Time Yields<br /> The Spilling of Blood.<br /> <br /> I am not finished with it by a long shot and at the moment I have a 51 page document outlining the Chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can already picture a smart ass mage responding to that prophecy. &quot;IS this about preventing the destruction of magic, or the forming of Voltron? Because this sounds like a synopsis of the plot of Voltron.&quot;<br /> <br /> Edit: By the way I love it! I hope this game can be formed so I can know enough to play in that game, it sounds cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":600,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","user":"HaplessWithDice","date":". 07-08-2017, 10:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T08:51:41-07:00","id":1113269,"title":"","content":"My work and personal life schedules just don't accommodate real-time games the way they used to. I need to stick to PbP games for now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T09:20:11-07:00","id":1113275,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8136_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8136\" data-vbnamecard=\"8136\">rwknoll</a> That's fine. And PbP is what I am looking for anyway.<br /> <br /> Looks like we have 3 players, one of whom may be the ST. if no other ST comes forward, of course","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":600,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","user":"HaplessWithDice","date":". 07-08-2017, 12:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T20:04:44-07:00","id":1114006,"title":"","content":"If it isn't clear, I'm not 100% sure on what I'm doing...but I think of ending the recruitment period by Wednesday at 11:59:59 PM, or Midnight on Thursday if there isn't any more interest, are the rest of you okay with that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-13T01:56:12-07:00","id":1115430,"title":"","content":"Thank you everyone! I'll be private messaging everyone who expressed interest to confirm continued interest and turning everything over to the ST.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-13T05:40:51-07:00","id":1115488,"title":"","content":"Hey all. I'm cool with being the ST, and because we are low on players (and I would still like a chance to be a player as well), I'm going to probably create my own character and treat them like a ST-run PC.<br /> <br /> Personally, I'm fine with not ending recruitment. I can try to recruit through other websites as well. But you two can have dedicated spots. <br /> <br /> I am currently very busy this week with moving out of my apartment into a house, so there may be some delays in finalizing things and setting up the game. A couple questions for you to help me brainstorm ideas:<br /> <br /> 1) In terms of setting, is my Mountain of Shadow game something you are interested in? That would be my preference, as I already have some story plots and NPC ideas. <br /> <br /> 2) What is your preferred power level? Instead of starting at base XP, do you want to get some bonus XP or get free dots of Gnosis, etc.?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-13T08:30:45-07:00","id":1115538,"title":"","content":"I do not know of your mountain of shadow game so I could not come to on that except to say that anything is good by me.<br /> <br /> The EXP level that I would like to see is low-mid to mid (10 to 15 exp ). And let us know if we are based in a single city or traveling mages. Maybe a max of 3 Gnosis to keep things interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 07-13-2017, 11:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-13T17:16:20-07:00","id":1115720,"title":"","content":"I also don't know anything about Mountain of Shadow but it sounds interesting. I'd be willing to try it.<br /> As for starting EXP 10 is about as high as I'd like to go, but I think 5 would have been a very good point since this is my first game of Mage. Too much EXP would be overwhelming, but 10 seems to be a good balance between Hardwire and myself. So I'm going to say 10 EXP, and a Cap on Gnosis for the start of game at 3.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T04:45:18-07:00","id":1115882,"title":"","content":"As for concept I was looking at a Supernatural Bounty Hunter/Private Investigator. Will that work with the Mountain of Shadows game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T07:08:48-07:00","id":1115933,"title":"","content":"I could potentially be interested in this if you'd have me!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5036-ambersand","name":"Ambersand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T15:32:43-07:00","id":1116135,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1115882#post1115882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for concept I was looking at a Supernatural Bounty Hunter/Private Investigator. Will that work with the Mountain of Shadows game.</div> </div> </div> </div>I searched up the game, it's set in the Denver area and the rural areas in the mountains around it. The gauntlet is super thin and the werewolf population is swollen because of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T00:15:36-07:00","id":1116281,"title":"","content":"Yeah, here is the link with the setting overview. Please check it out and see what you think: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...ains-of-shadow</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5036-ambersand\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5036\" data-vbnamecard=\"5036\">Ambersand</a> - Absolutely! Let me know your answers to some of my questions posed above regarding setting and power level.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T02:23:24-07:00","id":1116306,"title":"","content":"Cool setting, I have always enjoyed my visits to the Denver Area. It looks like my concept of a Supernatural Bounty Hunter/Private Investigator will work. He could actually be used by both Mage and Werewolf society to help broker peace. That may even be a good theme to base a Cabal on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T04:01:04-07:00","id":1116319,"title":"","content":"I do not find a Legacy that would go with being a bounty hunter does anyone have any ideas. I am looking at being an Obrimos with Prime as my main focus and either Matter, Life or Spirit to match up with the Prime.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 07-15-2017, 07:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T04:07:01-07:00","id":1116322,"title":"","content":"I can't remember any either. Best thing you can do is create one in game","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T04:33:56-07:00","id":1116329,"title":"","content":"Well I was looking at the Eleventh Question and I don't mind going that route I would just need to move some dots around and go Time/Matter as it stands I could go with the following mix.<ul><li><b>Prime:</b> 2</li> <li><b>Forces:</b> 1</li> <li><b>Matter:</b> 1</li> <li><b>Time:</b> 2</li> <li><b>Spirit:</b> 1 (4 Experience)</li> <li><b>Death:</b> 1 (4 Experience)</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T07:10:26-07:00","id":1116368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rwknoll</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1115488#post1115488\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) In terms of setting, is my Mountain of Shadow game something you are interested in? That would be my preference, as I already have some story plots and NPC ideas.<br /> <br /> 2) What is your preferred power level? Instead of starting at base XP, do you want to get some bonus XP or get free dots of Gnosis, etc.?</div> </div> </div> </div>1: Setting seems groovy by me.<br /> 2: I've found 5xp to be the best starting point. Enough xp to get most concepts working without being overinflated.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> You'd want 11Q, Tamers of Wind, Stone Scribes, Sphinx or wraiths of epoch for general investigative nerds. Each varying from Sherlock to history nerds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5036-ambersand","name":"Ambersand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T08:53:18-07:00","id":1116416,"title":"","content":"So for my character Charon I his central theme would be Afterlife Advocate. But his concepts is harder to explain. He's normally a peace maker, trying to <b>end</b> conflicts without violence. Yet if he feels the peace isn't helpful he will <b>end</b> the peace and bring about a cleansing conflict. I haven't picked a day job for him yet. That could feed into his concept, but mostly I want him to focus around death both literal and metaphoric. Maybe a HR director? Or maybe his mother and sister were Uratha, and after becoming a mage he became clued in, and allowed to know the family secret of his mother's family tree.<br /> <br /> Still kicking around some ideas there. Might be good honestly. Facing a few things and having to try to find some kind of balance point so finding out you're sister who you thought was a protective, normal, older sister was in truth a Werewolf of the full moon aspect who was protecting her brother from the dangers of both the human and spirit world. You know the more I talk about this mage from a werewolf family idea the more I like it...<br /> <br /> I think my concept will be <b>Ambassador of the wolves</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T10:54:42-07:00","id":1116470,"title":"","content":"<b>Briar Rabbit </b>is likely what most people think of when they think about the Acanthus. Carefree, foolish, spontaneous, yet as prone to cruel barbs and malevolent grudges as benign aid. She's also fairly foolish. Serving as the Daoine Maithe for the Guardians of the Veil, Briar is a skilled manipulator both mundane and mystical. Her preferences are in the labyrinth, where she ensures that only the worthy get to awaken, while the less deserving remain trapped in the honey pot. She advertises herself as a career agent, whose able to get you that guaranteed well paying gig and she can. That gig can be as much blessing as a curse, however, as you may be stuck in the well paying bar gig with no room for supernal growth just as easily as she can weave the web that causes the crisis of faith that sparks the flash of genius that leads to awakening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5036-ambersand","name":"Ambersand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T12:30:38-07:00","id":1116506,"title":"","content":"James Wilkerson, known in the Awakened society as Bad Dawg, is an Obrimos Guardian that is less concerned with the Labyrinth and more concerned with those that have slipped through. Though only awakened for a short while, he has been a PI for over twenty years and whoever is letting these fools through the Labyrinth should have their head examined. He investigates the crimes that the sleepers can\u2019t, the crimes that are best kept in the shadows. He has a reputation as a man that walks the middle of the road. He will just as easily take a job for one of the wolves as he will for a mage, and as such he must remain neutral. Mages, wolves, bloodsuckers, hell even a ghost if they needed it, he will help whoever has the money to hire him.<br /> <br /> P.S. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5036-ambersand\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5036\" data-vbnamecard=\"5036\">Ambersand</a>, I am not taking a poke at your character as a Guardian of the Labyrinth, he just feels that someone is asleep at the wheel.<br /> <br /> And I did go with the 11Q, thanks for the advice. I also like the Sphinx. Well at this time he hasn't taken any Legacy but he is setting things up to join the 11Q.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8136_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8136\" data-vbnamecard=\"8136\">rwknoll</a> I have currently built the Character on 10 points let me know if I need to shave 5 points off of that. 5 points is a little lower than I wanted to go but I can work with anything and all is go. It boils down to what are you comfortable with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 07-15-2017, 03:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T07:43:28-07:00","id":1116837,"title":"","content":"So far I have a few ideas that expand upon his post awakening self. I'd like to hear what the ST thinks of these.<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>His first magic teacher was his mother, pack's Ithaeur, and a bone shadow. (Would like to take her with mentor merit)<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>She was able to help him with Death, Forces, and Spirit magic.</li> </ol></li> <li>It wasn't until later when the Guardians realized that there was a mage being taught by werewolves that they dispatched the Adamant Arrow to collect him, hopefully peacefully.</li> <li>There was substantial negotiations around him and about him, the Pack finally agreed to let him go on the condition he still retains his membership and fealty to the pack.<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>He knows some of their secrets and the wolves don't trust the mages with these.</li> <li>He was indoctrinated as one of them.</li> <li>He is the son of the Ithaeur, and a son of Death Wolf, and bears the markings of these things.</li> </ol></li> <li>The Arrow indoctrinated him next, and while they found they could not turn his loyalty against the pack, and the werewolf sigils carved into his skin were unnerving, they did find that he accepted mage culture, adapted and his former instructor hadn't done so bad in teaching him to use his power, so much so that he still meets with her.</li> <li>The Arrow had to mix werewolf hunting culture with their own conflict brings growth mentality but it works (mostly, sorta, kinda, better than hothing)</li> <li>The Arrow Mages consider him their ambassador to the Pack, and the pack consider him their Liaison with the mages.</li> <li>Werewolf Mother Issues.</li> </ol>I made this a numbered list so you could tell me if any parts of this need to be nixed or altered and which parts just by giving the number reference.<br /> For everyone else I'm having a bit of trouble thinking of a good Legacy for him. Any ideas? Also I'm noticing parts of the original background I posted that are going to be falling away, including the shadow name as it now seems much less fitting. And a Shadow Name like Romulus, Mowgli,or Death Wolf would be more fitting than Charon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T12:54:56-07:00","id":1116950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1116506#post1116506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">P.S. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5036-ambersand\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5036\" data-vbnamecard=\"5036\">Ambersand</a>, I am not taking a poke at your character as a Guardian of the Labyrinth, he just feels that someone is asleep at the wheel.</div> </div> </div> </div>fight me irl i'm jacked<br /> <br /> But seriously you're going to put a basis for a tie that juicy and then imply it's not related to my character?? Maybe my character <i>is</i> a hedonist, maybe she <i>is</i> incompetent. Maybe she <i>is</i> struggling in her duties as a Cultor. Maybe she's eyeing another order to join. You'd be a fool to not embrace this. A FOOOOOL!!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5036-ambersand","name":"Ambersand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T13:22:16-07:00","id":1116961,"title":"","content":"lol, Never know who is thin shined when dealing with unknown people. There are players that would have taken offence to what I was saying and gotten all but hurt about it. I just cover my bases until i know how i am dealing with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T13:44:47-07:00","id":1116966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambersand</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1116950#post1116950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">fight me irl i'm jacked<br /> <br /> But seriously you're going to put a basis for a tie that juicy and then imply it's not related to my character?? Maybe my character <i>is</i> a hedonist, maybe she <i>is</i> incompetent. Maybe she <i>is</i> struggling in her duties as a Cultor. Maybe she's eyeing another order to join. You'd be a fool to not embrace this. A FOOOOOL!!</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah we should probably figure out how we all fit together.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5036-ambersand\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5036\" data-vbnamecard=\"5036\">Ambersand</a> So, how are we connected? We figured out how you and Hardwire are but what about us? Does your character view me as a freak? As a savage? Was I one of the ones that slipped through in your watch? If your character is a Hedonist I could see my character having respect for that, and her choice to live how se wants too, even if that chase is just for your own pleasure, though I could also see him seeing you as possibly hurt.<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> How do you view my character? I can picture my character respecting you as a hunter and a warrior.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":600,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","user":"HaplessWithDice","date":". 07-16-2017, 05:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T17:35:33-07:00","id":1117020,"title":"","content":"Diante Johnson, Shadowname: Darwin<br /> <br /> Diante was tired of corporate life, and near the end of his office tenure, he started having subversive thoughts and visions. He developed an opposition defiance disorder and got terminated from his job due to a spat with middle management. Throughout these events, Diante kept imagining that he and other people were being kept in shadows; he believed life was just a sleepy play put on each day, with the real machinations occurring offstage. He threw out all his possessions, all except for an old lead coin a friend has given him years ago. <br /> <br /> Unwilling to go quietly into the night, Diante starting reading more, and he stumbled upon a person of the night that offered housing and resources, if Diante worked as their Retainer (this could be a negative quality.) Diante agreed to this, and wisely said nothing about making acquaintances with a vampire. <br /> <br /> Not long after, Diante found himself shoving aside curtains, mirrors, and other obfuscations in his dreams, until he witnessed, against a Stygian horizon, the Watchtower of the Lead Coin. Diante approached the tower and pressed his coin against its side, and harnessing newfound energy, inscribed his shadowname into it's stone base. Now a mage, Diante wishes to uplift the minds of other, and help forge destinies locked away by the oppressive great Lie.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T19:31:25-07:00","id":1117050,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12742_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12742\" data-vbnamecard=\"12742\">Doggo</a> Interesting but that puts 2 Moros in the game, while mine seems like he would be different from yours, and I can't think of it causing a problem other than would they be two of nearly the same character?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-17T01:17:54-07:00","id":1117119,"title":"","content":"Just because there are two Moros in the game doesn't make them the same. They can be very different.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-17T15:10:34-07:00","id":1117465,"title":"","content":"Thanks Hardwire<br /> \u200bJust waiting on <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8136_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8136\" data-vbnamecard=\"8136\">rwknoll</a> to respond to my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1116837#post1116837\">earlier post </a>so I can do merits. then I'll have the base ready to go for when we find out how much starting XP we get.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-18T08:55:52-07:00","id":1117779,"title":"","content":"I suppose I should be awaiting a response from <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8136_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8136\" data-vbnamecard=\"8136\">rwknoll</a> as well!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-18T10:13:23-07:00","id":1117822,"title":"","content":"Hey all! Another update. The move itself went well, and all of our stuff is in the house! However, we have already had some major unexpected issues, including two instances of sewage flooding in our basement. I've been pretty stressed and busy these last few days, so might be later this week before things settle down. I'll be back here posting as soon as possible. Thanks for your continued patience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-18T16:30:54-07:00","id":1117996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rwknoll</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1117822#post1117822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey all! Another update. The move itself went well, and all of our stuff is in the house! However, we have already had some major unexpected issues, including two instances of sewage flooding in our basement. I've been pretty stressed and busy these last few days, so might be later this week before things settle down. I'll be back here posting as soon as possible. Thanks for your continued patience.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hope things start getting better for you man.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T06:07:03-07:00","id":1119482,"title":"","content":"Things have settled down a bit. I will try to post later today if I have time, or tomorrow at the latest.<br /> <br /> Does anyone know of a reference for how much XP post-character creation corresponds with what level of character strength? Like in Mage 1E, there were Storyteller guidelines that said how much extra XP corresponded with beginner mages, experienced ones, and masters, etc. I suppose we could split the difference and go with something like 7? My only concern would be that I'm actually not very experienced yet with higher-XP Mage games and I want to make sure I do a good job running it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 07-23-2017, 09:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T06:24:32-07:00","id":1119485,"title":"","content":"Then go with 5 Experience and a cap on Gnosis of 2, I am fine with that either way. There is no comparison chart at the moment but you can become a Master with as little as 17 experience points and an Adept with a little as 4 experience points, that is if there is not cap on the players and where they can put their points. Experience of 5 with cap of 2 on Gnosis will create slightly above novice characters. With a cap of 2 Gnosis it will limit the characters to a max of 3 in their Arcana. This is a decent starting point for characters and limit what they can spring on you at any one time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T10:26:50-07:00","id":1119561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1119485#post1119485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then go with 5 Experience and a cap on Gnosis of 2, I am fine with that either way. There is no comparison chart at the moment but you can become a Master with as little as 17 experience points and an Adept with a little as 4 experience points, that is if there is not cap on the players and where they can put their points. Experience of 5 with cap of 2 on Gnosis will create slightly above novice characters. With a cap of 2 Gnosis it will limit the characters to a max of 3 in their Arcana. This is a decent starting point for characters and limit what they can spring on you at any one time.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this sounds good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T04:49:39-07:00","id":1120748,"title":"","content":"Okay up to <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/a4039gtek206z5c/Death%20Wolf.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">5XP spent</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T06:58:53-07:00","id":1121287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rwknoll</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1113090#post1113090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Paging <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5241\" data-vbnamecard=\"5241\">Flinty</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a>, who both asked me about a potential game and might still be interested.</div> </div> </div> </div>Took me long enough to see this... thank you for thinking of me! If you'd still have me I'd love to play, but it looks like you have a rather full ship by now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-01T03:39:32-07:00","id":1123385,"title":"","content":"Hey guys! Soooo sorry I have been MIA. I've had a lot going on in real life these past few weeks. I was also out of town this weekend, and I haven't been staying up as late this summer, so I haven't had much of an opportunity to respond. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5241\" data-vbnamecard=\"5241\">Flinty</a> - You can totally join. For PBP games, I have found that having a slightly larger group works better than a smaller one because there is a greater chance that a critical mass of players will stay active enough to keep the game going. So pitch a character with 5 XP and max Gnosis 2, and we will take it from there. <br /> <br /> Let's cap recruitment after that though. So that leaves the following:<br /> <br /> 1. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar600_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"600\" data-vbnamecard=\"600\">HaplessWithDice</a> - Charon (Moros Arrow)<br /> 2. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> - Bad Dawg (Obrimos Guardian)<br /> 3. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5036-ambersand\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5036\" data-vbnamecard=\"5036\">Ambersand</a> - Briar Rabbit (Acanthus Guardian)<br /> 4. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12742_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12742\" data-vbnamecard=\"12742\">Doggo</a> - Darwin (Moros ?)<br /> 5. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5241\" data-vbnamecard=\"5241\">Flinty</a> - TBD<br /> 6. Me - TBD (Thyrsus, maybe Arrow?)<br /> <br /> Doggo, I might have missed it but did you say what Order you want to be in?<br /> <br /> Thank you all for your patience. Sorry this hasn't kicked off nearly as fast as any of us would like. But I want to emphasize that I am definitely still interested, just waiting for a good opportunity to get things up and running.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatheri