"value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-01T04:36:04-07:00","id":1123403,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8136_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8136\" data-vbnamecard=\"8136\">rwknoll</a> My character evolved a bit since I made the initial pitch. New Shadow name is Kamduis-Ur.<br /> <br /> Edit: you should have my <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/a4039gtek206z5c/Death%20Wolf.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">character sheet</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":600,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","user":"HaplessWithDice","date":".  Added additional content 08-01-2017, 07:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-01T09:33:53-07:00","id":1123522,"title":"","content":"Wow, really? You use the name of one of the Firstborn as your Shadow Name? You do are asking for an interesting (if maybe short) life. And the Uratha you act as bridge between them and the mages are ok with that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-01T17:41:58-07:00","id":1123721,"title":"","content":"Yeah... I'm not sure the Pack would appreciate that, aside from all the other potentially horrid downsides.<br /> <br /> Two questions regarding char creation : are we allowed to start with a legacy at char creation? And are supernatural merits allowed? I'm specifically interested in psychic vampirism from hurt locker","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-01T17:52:01-07:00","id":1123724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1123522#post1123522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow, really? You use the name of one of the Firstborn as your Shadow Name? You do are asking for an interesting (if maybe short) life. And the Uratha you act as bridge between them and the mages are ok with that?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it depends. If the pack sees it as flattery coming from a former member of the pack, to honor mother wolf by taking upon himself her name. Or as insult by profaning the name of mother wolf.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-01T18:40:59-07:00","id":1123733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flinty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1123721#post1123721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah... I'm not sure the Pack would appreciate that, aside from all the other potentially horrid downsides.<br /> <br /> Two questions regarding char creation : are we allowed to start with a legacy at char creation? And are supernatural merits allowed? I'm specifically interested in psychic vampirism from hurt locker</div> </div> </div> </div>Supernatural Merits are lost when a template taken. At least that is what the book says. Though I am not the ST so not my call.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-01T23:59:16-07:00","id":1123784,"title":"","content":"Are you looking for one more? I have an idea for a Thrysus street artist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-02T03:38:25-07:00","id":1123819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BurritoMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1123784#post1123784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you looking for one more? I have an idea for a Thrysus street artist.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the interest, but we are full now, sorry.<br /> <br /> Gang, I'm going to invite us over to the OOC thread for my old game and resurrect it. Let's start posting there. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar600_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"600\" data-vbnamecard=\"600\">HaplessWithDice</a>, you might want to request this thread to be closed or to change the title so people don't keep thinking we are still actively recruiting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T09:05:19-07:00","id":1128476,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry I never got to this and it sounds like all of you are geared up and ready to go, but I really appreciate the invite that <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8136_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8136\" data-vbnamecard=\"8136\">rwknoll</a> sent my way for this game.<br /> <br /> His suspicion that I'm more interested in Vampire games is correct, but I might have been willing to give this a shot too. I'm just looking for a good, organized entry point into some kind of game.<br /> <br /> Unfortunate that I missed out on this opportunity. Is there something I can do to stay in contact or add you as a friend over these forums?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain","name":"Gentle_Rain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T09:18:51-07:00","id":1128481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gentle_Rain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1128476#post1128476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sorry I never got to this and it sounds like all of you are geared up and ready to go, but I really appreciate the invite that <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8136_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8136\" data-vbnamecard=\"8136\">rwknoll</a> sent my way for this game.<br /> <br /> His suspicion that I'm more interested in Vampire games is correct, but I might have been willing to give this a shot too. I'm just looking for a good, organized entry point into some kind of game.<br /> <br /> Unfortunate that I missed out on this opportunity. Is there something I can do to stay in contact or add you as a friend over these forums?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, it's all good! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Several of the players who originally signed up for this game have since not responded to me or apparently gone inactive. I'm going to start reaching out to people on the wait list to see if some of them are still interested. If we end up having an opening, I will reach out to you via PM. You're also more than welcome to subscribe to the OOC or IC threads for either of my games. The OOC thread for this game has moved to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\">this thread instead</a>. Feel free to check it out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T18:13:46-07:00","id":1128651,"title":"","content":"Thanks again.<br /> <br /> I'm not all that familiar with Mage: The Awakening, but I do have a copy of the first edition rulebook lying around and could try to read it in order to catch up. I'm not necessarily sure I want to get a copy of 2E just yet, but could look up rules in an ad hoc way or rely on other people's understanding of them for the purposes of playing. Does PbP just forego dice rolls altogether? What are the relevant mechanics?<br /> <br /> Definitely consider PMing me if people drop out, and we'll talk further.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain","name":"Gentle_Rain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T19:31:39-07:00","id":1128675,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13431_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13431\" data-vbnamecard=\"13431\">Gentle_Rain</a> I can help you with rules, and everything like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T03:33:27-07:00","id":1128746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gentle_Rain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113048-recruitment-new-mage-the-awakening-2e-player-seeks-game-or-to-start-one?p=1128651#post1128651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks again.<br /> <br /> I'm not all that familiar with Mage: The Awakening, but I do have a copy of the first edition rulebook lying around and could try to read it in order to catch up. I'm not necessarily sure I want to get a copy of 2E just yet, but could look up rules in an ad hoc way or rely on other people's understanding of them for the purposes of playing. Does PbP just forego dice rolls altogether? What are the relevant mechanics?<br /> <br /> Definitely consider PMing me if people drop out, and we'll talk further.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are very significant changes between 1E and 2E, so if you want to play in the Mage 2E game, you would definitely need access to the book in some capacity to play.<br /> <br /> With PBP games, we do indeed use rolls, using online dice roll website that archive rolls so we can all see the results at any time. I use <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/?action=roll\" target=\"_blank\">Orokos</a> for CoD games because it allows for complex options related to rolling dice. You can also check out my IC thread for my other game, The Supernal Suburbia, in my signature line for examples of how this works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T21:41:23-07:00","id":1129110,"title":"","content":"Okay.<br /> <br /> I think I might pass on this round, since I don't have the book, am more interested in Vampire, and it looks like there's a Vampire game I might be joining. However, I'd definitely like to keep in touch with you in the future, since my access to the book could change and I might be willing to play at a later date.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain","name":"Gentle_Rain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-08T11:35:34-07:00","id":1454534,"title":"","content":"Hallo everybody,<br /> i'm new to this forum and i don't know if you are still playing.<br /> If so i'd like to apply to play mage here.<br /> I've already played a pbp mage in the past as character.<br /> <br /> I've got two character ideas:<br /> 1- A thyrsus healer of the free council. A lone wolf survivalist. One day some journalist filmed him while curing an ailment. From that day on, unwanted fame fell on him.<br /> 2- A mastigos of the mysterium. An investigator specialized in space magic. His main goal would be to explore other planets with the aid of his magic.<br /> <br /> Please knock at my door if you are interested.<br /> <br /> cheers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26941-brax79","name":"Brax79","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}